{"articleNo":"82693","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=82693&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013년 장애대학생 대기업 채용설명회","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.05.06","hit":"3576","attachments":[{"name":"114.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=82693&attachNo=71499"},{"name":"113.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=82693&attachNo=71559"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0.3pt 1.6pt 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">행 사 명 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2013년 장애대학생 대기업 채용설명회</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0.3pt 1.6pt 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">행사일시 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2013. 5. 31. (금) 13:00~18:00</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0.3pt 1.6pt 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">행사장소 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">: aT센터 5층 대회의실(서울시 서초구 소재)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0.3pt 1.6pt 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">행사규모</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0.3pt 1.6pt 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ο 대기업(30대 기업집단, 1,000인상 사업체), 공공기관 등 15개소</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0.3pt 1.6pt 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ο 기졸업 또는 재/휴학 중인 장애대학생 200여명</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0.3pt 1.6pt 7.2pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;마. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">행사내용 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 채용설명회, 각종 부대행사(기업별 채용정보관, 취업컨설팅관, 공단 홍보관 등) 운영</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0.3pt 1.6pt 10.5pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;바. 참가신청 </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0.3pt 1.6pt 10.5pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">1)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 신청기간 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2013. 5. 24. (금) 18:00까지 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0.3pt 1.6pt 8.1pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">신청방법 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 개인단위로 신청 가능하며, 제출처에 우편, 팩스, 이메일로 신청서류 송부</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0.3pt 1.6pt 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">신청서류</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0.3pt 1.6pt 10.5pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ο 개인별 신청: 참가 신청서([별첨 1] 양식 참조)v</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0.3pt 1.6pt 10.5pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) 제출처 : 한국장애인고용공단 취업지원부(담당자 : 안희 과장)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0.3pt 1.6pt 10.5pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ο 주소 : (463-939) 경기도 성남시 분당구 구미로 173-59</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0.3pt 1.6pt 10.5pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ο TEL :031-728-7298, FAX:050-3470-0030</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0.3pt 1.6pt 10.5pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ο E-mail : <a href=\"mailto:ho5a@kead.or.kr\">ho5a@kead.or.kr</a></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0.3pt 1.6pt 10.5pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0.3pt 1.6pt 10.5pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0.3pt 1.6pt 10.5pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0.3pt 1.6pt 10.5pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">**기타문의사항 : 첨부파일참조</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0.3pt 1.6pt 10.5pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;금오공과대학교 상담지도센터 김주희 054)478-7937</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
